itions normalise.","It spends 0.5% of revenue on stock compensation."],"hlth":["The company holds more cash than debt."],"growth":["Revenue has compounded at 5.5% over 3 years, 4.8% over 5 years and 4.7% over 10 years, and it has been lumpy (year-to-year swings of 14%).","Free cash flow has compounded 25.1% a year over five years.","Forward indicators: a book-to-bill of 1.00, a backlog worth 0% of annual revenue and FFO growth of 6.0% a year over five years.","Capex runs only 0.2x depreciation (8.3% of sales), so the asset base is being harvested rather than grown."],"own":["Insiders hold little stock (0.7%), and reported institutional holdings exceed 100% of shares (a sign of heavy share lending).","It returns 3.5% a year to shareholders (3.8% in dividends).","It pays out 192% of earnings, more than it earns, so the dividend is at risk."],"people":["With about 1,686 employees, each generates about $1.1M of revenue, 0.5x the Real Estate median, and revenue has grown 10.6% a year across its filed history.","CEO pay is $5.4M (5x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores well (1/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $6K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":58,"head":"Avoid: priced 70% above its fair value of $161.","pros":["Composite 41, above the 39 line (gates 11/25)","Net debt/EBITDA -0.1x","12-1 month momentum +11%","Returns 3.5% a year to shareholders"],"cons":["Trades 70% above fair value of $161","P/E 50.7x vs sector 23.9x"],"flags":["Priced 70% above its fair value of $161"],"need":[],"buy_below":136.67,"vc":{"base":160.78,"base_src":"blend","bear":null,"bull":null,"alt_median":160.78,"n_alt":2,"gap":null,"dispersion":0.3098,"level":"LOW","why":["models disagree (31% dispersion)"]},"med":{"pe":23.8785,"ev_ebitda":16.1705,"pfcf":17.849,"pb":1.3551,"roic":0.0405,"gross_margin":0.5564,"fcf_margin":0.1712,"div_yield":0.0475}},"ticker":"ESS","date":"2026-11-13"}